eleting them.",feature:o.Feature.BucketMirroring,section:"dataUploadIngestion",controlType:"checkbox",order:430,overwriteOnPlanChange:!0,category:"product"},[i.BucketMirrorPrivateLink]:{id:i.BucketMirrorPrivateLink,name:"Bucket Mirror Private Link (VPCE)",description:"Allow this workspace to use the AWS PrivateLink (VPC endpoint) path for bucket mirroring. When off, resolving an assignment flagged with requireVpce fails with a PRIVATE_LINK_FEATURE_DISABLED error.",feature:o.Feature.BucketMirrorPrivateLink,section:"dataUploadIngestion",controlType:"checkbox",order:431,overwriteOnPlanChange:!1,category:"product"},[i.ModelEvaluationTrainSet]:{id:i.ModelEvaluationTrainSet,name:"Model Evaluation Train Set",description:"Allow model evaluation to include the training set. Generally excluded since training split data is what the model trained on.",section:"trainingModels",controlType:"checkbox",order:450,overwriteOnPlanChange:!0,category:"product"},[i.FilterByTags]:{id:i.FilterByTags,name:"Filter By Tags",description:"Allow model evaluation to filter by tags.",section:"datasetVersionManagement",controlType:"checkbox",order:460,overwriteOnPlanChange:!0,category:"product"},[i.DisableAutoInstantModelTraining]:{id:i.DisableAutoInstantModelTraining,name:"Disable Auto Instant Model Training",description:"Disable auto-triggered instant model training. Enabling this flag DISABLES the RF Instant model trigger.",section:"trainingModels",controlType:"checkbox",order:470,overwriteOnPlanChange:!0,category:"behavior"},[i.TrtOnDemandCompilation]:{id:i.TrtOnDemandCompilation,name:"TRT On Demand Compilation",description:"Allow on-demand TensorRT compilation jobs.",section:"deploymentInference",controlType:"checkbox",order:500,overwriteOnPlanChange:!0,category:"product"},[i.GatedModelPackagesRetrieval]:{id:i.GatedModelPackagesRetrieval,name:"Gated Model Packages Retrieval",description:"Allow client running outside the platform to download gate-keeped model packages (like TensorRT engines) of