otations used with <a href=\'https://models.roboflow.com/instance-segmentation/yolov5-obb\'>yolov5_obb</a>.">\n                    YOLOv5 Oriented Bounding Boxes</option>\n                <option value="yolov8-obb"\n                    description="TXT annotations used with <a href=\'https://roboflow.com/model/yolov8-obb\'>yolov8_obb</a>.">\n                    YOLOv8 Oriented Bounding Boxes</option>\n            </optgroup>\n            <optgroup label="--- Convert To Object Detection ---"></optgroup>\n            <optgroup label="JSON">\n                <option value="coco"\n                    description="JSON annotations used with <a href=\'https://models.roboflow.com/object-detection/efficientdet\' target=\'_blank\'>EfficientDet Pytorch</a> and <a href=\'https://models.roboflow.com/object-detection/detectron2\'>Detectron 2</a>.">\n                    COCO</option>\n                <option value="coco-mmdetection"\n                    description="JSON annotations used with <a href=\'https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmdetection\' target=\'_blank\'>MMDetection</a>.">\n                    COCO-MMDetection</option>\n                <option value="createml"\n                    description="Proprietary JSON format used with Apple\'s CreateML and Turi Create tools.">CreateML\n                </option>\n                <option value="paligemma"\n                    description="JSONL annotations used to fine-tune <a href=\'https://roboflow.com/model/paligemma\'>PaliGemma</a>.">\n                    PaliGemma</option>\n                <option value="florence2-od"\n                    description="JSONL annotations used to fine-tune <a href=\'https://roboflow.com/model/florence-2\'>Florence 2</a> for Object Detection.">\n                    Florence 2 Object Detection</option>\n            </optgroup>\n\n            <optgroup label="XML">\n                <option value="voc"\n                    description="Common XML format for local data munging (not often used directl