erenceRun",name:l.UBP_FEATURE_GROUP_NAMES.serverlessInferenceRun,icon:"far fa-cloud-plus",type:d.deployment.id,description:"Our Serverless Hosted API is more powerful than our legacy API, running inferences on GPU architecture with the ability to call VLMs and additional models. We calculate the sum total of seconds that the models are run for. Due to the nature of workflows executing multiple models in parallel, it is possible for the inference execution to exceed actual time passed. <a href='https://docs.roboflow.com/deploy/serverless-hosted-api-v2' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer'>Read more</a>.",unitMeasurementName:"second"},hostedInferenceImages:{id:"hostedInferenceImages",name:l.UBP_FEATURE_GROUP_NAMES.hostedInferenceImages,icon:"far fa-cloud",type:d.deployment.id,deprecated:!0,description:"<span>(Legacy) Hosted inference v1 endpoint. Each API call to our <a href='https://docs.roboflow.com/deploy/hosted-api' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer'>hosted inference endpoint</a> counts as one Inference, no matter how many classes (if any) were detected. Workflows on the Hosted Inference API will be billed per model where an inference is run (there are often multiple inference per Workflow).</span>",unitMeasurementName:"inference"},batchVideoInference:{id:"batchVideoInference",name:l.UBP_FEATURE_GROUP_NAMES.batchVideoInference,icon:"far fa-cloud",type:d.deployment.id,deprecated:!0,description:"(Legacy) Hosted inference v1 endpoint. Videos submitted to the Hosted Video Inference API. Credits are consumed per minute of video FPS.",conversionRateTransform:e=>e/60,unitMeasurementName:"minute"},batchProcessingCPU:{id:"batchProcessingCPU",name:l.UBP_FEATURE_GROUP_NAMES.batchProcessingCPU,icon:"far fa-list-check",type:d.deployment.id,description:"Length of time Batch Processing CPU machines are running.",conversionRateTransform:e=>60*e*60,unitMeasurementName:"hour"},batchProcessingGPU:{id:"batchProcessingGPU",name:l.UBP_FEATURE_GROUP_NAMES.batchProcessingGPU,icon:"far fa-list-